OL,3,GNEWSANew heritage trail remembers
OL,4,AGlasgow's legendary nightclubs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe closure of some of Glasgow's best
OL,7,Fknown nightclubs has inspired one of
OL,8,Ftheir regulars to delve into their
OL,9,Fhistory - through a new walking trail.
OL,11,FThe Lost Nightclubs tour takes in
OL,12,FArchaos, the Arches and the Tunnel, as
OL,13,Fwell as some of the city's lesser known
OL,14,Fhotspots.
OL,16,FIt was created by archivist Nella
OL,17,FMcNicol - who believes Glasgow's
OL,18,Fnightlife deserves just as much
OL,19,Fcelebration as its A-listed buildings
OL,20,Fand Gothic architecture.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
