OL,3,GNEWSANew heritage trail remembers
OL,4,AGlasgow's legendary nightclubs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe tour is taking place to mark Doors
OL,7,FOpen Day, which will see scores of
OL,8,Flocations across the city open up over
OL,9,Fthe weekend to allow visitors a look
OL,10,Faround.
